## Context

Nine documents outside the three waves: implementation plans 4 (ZAF 1, SEN 1,
VNM 2), investment plans 3 (ZAF 1, SEN 1, VNM 1) and approval documents 2
(SEN 1, ZAF 1). Large one-off PDFs, so no repeated-series parser applies. Some
may be earlier or later editions of a document already extracted (the four M1a
documents include the Indonesian and Senegalese plans): 1501 decides that with
`edition_of` before anything is read here.

## Work

- LLM-assisted reading with row-by-row diff review, per document, at a stated
  budget; hand-read files stay per document, reviewed in the PR.
- A document that is an edition of an extracted one follows the edition rules:
  new lines, new ids, no renumbering.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] Each of the 9 has lines or a recorded disposition
- [ ] Editions are related by `edition_of`, never merged into an existing document's lines
- [ ] Lines of previously extracted documents are byte-identical
- [ ] `make jetp-ledger-check`, `make check-fast` and `make lint` pass
